"17 times higher than Mount Everest. Less than 20% of e-waste is collected "
"and recycled. Although e-waste makes up less than 2% of trash in landfills, "
"it contributes to almost 70% of the toxic waste found in them. (Image from "
"KDE published under a [CC-BY-SA-4.0](https://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-SA-4.0."
