"[Poison](https://thenounproject.com/icon/poison-3201818/) icon by Adrien "
"Coquet, all licensed under a [CC-BY](https://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-3.0."
"html) license. Design by Lana Lutz.)](images/sec1_e-waste-infographic.png)"
msgstr ""
"![В 2016 году было образовано 44,7 млн метрических тонн электронных отходов. "
