#: content/blog/2026-07-22-opt-green-end-part-i-repair-cafes.md:141
msgid ""
"The Opt Green project was funded by the Federal Environment Agency (UBA) and "
"the Federal Ministry for the Environment, Climate Action, Nature "
"Conservation and Nuclear Safety (BMUKN<sup><a id=\"fnr.1\" class=\"footref\" "
