msgstr ""
"[Linux не устанавливается](https://www.ifixit.com/Troubleshooting/Linux/Not"
"+Installing/616642)"

#: content/opt-green-handbook/index.md:732
msgid ""
"[Bitlocker](https://documentation.ubuntu.com/desktop/en/latest/reference/"
